WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.337
Welcome to The Motoring Central. Everything your car needs, in one place. Here's a quick tour of the whole site.

00:00:07.087 --> 00:00:15.791
Start on the front page. Type what you need, in your own words. You can tap the microphone and say it, or tap a quick button, like Car service, or MOT.

00:00:16.541 --> 00:00:21.298
As you type, matching problems and services appear. Just tap the one that sounds right.

00:00:22.048 --> 00:00:30.795
Not sure what's wrong? Tap “Let a garage or mechanic decide”. Local experts check your car, then tell you what it needs, and the price, before any work starts.

00:00:31.545 --> 00:00:36.857
Every booking follows four simple steps, shown at the top of the page, so you always know where you are.

00:00:37.607 --> 00:00:40.444
Register for free, then enter your registration.

00:00:41.194 --> 00:00:44.501
We find your exact car, so the parts and the prices are right.

00:00:45.251 --> 00:00:50.115
Compare checked local partners by price, rating and reviews, and choose the one you want.

00:00:50.865 --> 00:00:54.897
You see the full, fixed price before you book, and you pay securely online.

00:00:55.647 --> 00:00:59.743
Want to look around? Tap “Browse all services” to see everything we offer.

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:10.648
Book an MOT at a local garage, new tyres fitted at your door, or recovery if you've broken down. There's also valeting, bodywork, locksmiths, and electric car charging.

00:01:11.398 --> 00:01:17.905
Looking for your next car or van? Search for it the same way. For example, automatic, under twenty thousand pounds.

00:01:18.655 --> 00:01:23.092
Then narrow it down by make, price, mileage and more, and message the dealer directly.

00:01:23.842 --> 00:01:28.343
You can compare RAC breakdown cover too, and find the level that suits you.

00:01:29.093 --> 00:01:33.594
Your bookings, quotes, reminders and messages are all in one place, in My account.

00:01:34.344 --> 00:01:39.357
Need a hand? Chat to our team, or ask for a call back. You're always dealing with real people.

00:01:40.107 --> 00:01:45.099
The Motoring Central. Buy, fix, clean, rescue. Type what you need, and let's get started.
